r or undermine the enemy, and capture structures to gain additional resources or deployment sites.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/a5d835c0b9703fce54f360b1445627a6.poster.avif?t=1741787135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/a5d835c0b9703fce54f360b1445627a6.webm?t=1741787135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/a5d835c0b9703fce54f360b1445627a6.mp4?t=1741787135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/73d2b268cdce982e315f75c659d5610d.avif?t=1741787135\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br>Inflict status effects, plant traps, support allies. Each type of Variable Armour is armed with its own specialist equipment and unique skills, allowing you to engage the enemy with a variety of tactical options. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/5b86de985d3ea12f9380ef4fdb06ecc6.poster.avif?t=1741787135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/5b86de985d3ea12f9380ef4fdb06ecc6.webm?t=1741787135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/5b86de985d3ea12f9380ef4fdb06ecc6.mp4?t=1741787135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/918950/extras/b003ad3027a108d3b9c10755631b6dcc.avif?t=1741787135\" width=616 heig